  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "Given, <math><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>b</mi><msup><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math><br /><br /><math> <mo>⇒&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn><msup><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br />Writing dimensions for <math><mi>a</mi></math> and <math><mi>c</mi></math>, we have<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mi>b</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>Q</mi><mo>/</mo><mi>V</mi></mrow></mfenced><msup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mi>B</mi></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Q</mi></mfenced><mo>[</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Q</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mo>]</mo><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><msup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Q</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></math><br /><br />&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<math><mo>=</mo><mo>[</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Q</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup><mo>]</mo></math>",
